{"title":"D-30","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=ytvBC/hAC1Vx3lWS/wr2EGkRlukd6CYVmiUrut1&filename=th3","synopsis":"학교폭력을 당해오던 이유진은 옥상에서 추락한다.\n6개월간의 의식불명 상태에서 겨우 깨어난 그는\n소꿉친구 박가영이 내민 도움의 손길도 거부하고 전학을 택한다.\n\n우연한 기회로 격투기를 시작한 그는\n어느덧 챔피언 결승전을 앞둘 만큼 성장하게 되고\n\n달라진 자신의 모습을 보여주고 싶어 박가영을 찾지만\n그녀는 자신이 전학 간 다음 날,\n일진 연합에 의해 살해당했다는 소식을 듣는다.\n\n충격에 빠진 상태로 결승전에 올랐던 이유진은\n놀랍게도 의식불명에 빠졌던 첫 날로 타임워프를 하는데?!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":299,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":298,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":295,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":299,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":298,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":297,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":157,"change":{"type":"up","amount":140}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":213,"change":{"type":"down","amount":56}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":248,"change":{"type":"down","amount":35}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":157,"change":{"type":"up","amount":91}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":219,"change":{"type":"down","amount":62}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":241,"change":{"type":"down","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":148,"change":{"type":"up","amount":93}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":142,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":188,"change":{"type":"down","amount":46}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":130,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":106,"change":{"type":"up","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":182,"change":{"type":"down","amount":76}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":229,"change":{"type":"down","amount":47}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":290,"change":{"type":"down","amount":61}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":299,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":296,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"202